    <string name="kq4_misc_tg_guide_title">Telegram bot yaratish</string>
    <string name="kq4_misc_tg_guide_body">1. Telegram → @BotFather toping\n2. /newbot bosib bot yarating, tokenni oling\n\n3. Yangi guruh yarating va botingizni qo\'shing\n\n4. Guruhga biror xabar yozing\n\n5. Brauzerda oching:\n   api.telegram.org/bot&lt;TOKEN&gt;/getUpdates\n   chat ni id ni oling (minus bilan)\n\n6. Bu yerga token va chat_id ni kiriting va Test bosing!</string>

