    <string name="kq4_misc_hidden_eyebrow">Chuqur tekshiruv</string>
    <string name="kq4_misc_hidden_title">Yashirin tahdidlar</string>
    <string name="kq4_misc_hidden_intro">Telefonda o\'rnatilgan, lekin ikonkasini yashirgan yoki o\'chirishga qarshilik qiladigan ilovalar. Agar ularni o\'zingiz bilib o\'rnatgan bo\'lsangiz — xavfsiz.</string>
